Are you an experienced leader creating economic opportunities and measurable benefits in your community? 

CSP is seeking leaders ages 27–39 with at least five years of relevant experience in areas such as: 

✅ Business and entrepreneurship 
✅ Technology and innovation 
✅ Hospitality and tourism 
✅ Culinary industries and food systems 
✅ Global trade and logistics 
✅ Rural entrepreneurship 
✅ Workforce and local economic development 

Selected participants will take part in a professional exchange in the United States in 2027, including a 12-week practicum with a U.S. organization. 

Participants will also develop a community-based SCALE-Up Project to implement after returning home. 

📅 Application deadline: November 24, 2026 
 🔗 Learn more and apply through https://www.irex.org/program/community-solutions-program-application-information

Tag an experienced leader who should apply! 

